---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NavBar from '../../components/ui/NavBar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/ui/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — NotesChatAI" description="NotesChatAI terms and conditions. Read our terms of service governing the use of our AI study assistant platform." keywords="noteschatai terms, terms of service, conditions, user agreement">
  <NavBar user={null} />

  <main>
    <section class="hero-band relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="terms-hero">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 mesh-gradient-bg opacity-[0.06]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
          <span class="badge-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6 font-caption-mono">
            Legal
          </span>
          <h1 id="terms-hero" class="font-display-xl text-ink mb-6 text-balance">
            Terms & Conditions
          </h1>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body text-balance">
            Last updated: August 24, 2026
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-band-light relative" aria-labelledby="terms-content">
      <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose-content space-y-8">

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              By accessing or using NotesChatAI (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions ("Terms"). If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              NotesChatAI is an AI-powered study assistant that allows users to upload documents, create a persistent knowledge base, and interact with AI to generate flashcards, quizzes, summaries, mind maps, and audio overviews.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">3. Eligibility</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              You must be at least 13 years old to use the Service. By using the Service, you represent that you meet this age requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">4. Account Registration</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-body-md text-body">
              <li>You must provide accurate and complete registration information.</li>
              <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account credentials.</li>
              <li>You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account.</li>
              <li>One person may not maintain more than one account.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">5. Your Content</h2>
            <h3 class="font-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">5.1 Ownership</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              You retain all rights to the documents, notes, and other content you upload to the Service ("Your Content"). We claim no ownership over Your Content.
            </p>
            <h3 class="font-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">5.2 License to Process</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              By uploading content, you grant us a limited license to process, index, and analyze Your Content solely to provide the Service to you. This license ends when you delete your content or account.
            </p>
            <h3 class="font-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">5.3 Your Responsibilities</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-body-md text-body">
              <li>You must have the right to upload all content you submit.</li>
              <li>You must not upload content that violates copyright, trademark, or other intellectual property rights.</li>
              <li>You must not upload malware, viruses, or harmful code.</li>
              <li>You must not use the Service to generate content that is illegal, harmful, or violates others' rights.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">6. AI-Generated Content</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              AI-generated responses, flashcards, quizzes, summaries, and other outputs ("AI Content") are provided for educational purposes. AI Content may contain inaccuracies. You are responsible for verifying AI Content before relying on it for academic or professional purposes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">7. Subscription Plans</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-body-md text-body">
              <li><strong class="text-ink">Free Plan:</strong> Subject to usage limits as described on our Pricing page.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-ink">Paid Plans:</strong> Billed in advance on a monthly or annual basis. You may cancel at any time; cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-ink">Refunds:</strong> We offer a full refund within 14 days of your first paid subscription. After that, refunds are prorated only where required by law.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-ink">Price Changes:</strong> We may change prices with 30 days' notice. Price changes apply to the next billing cycle.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">8. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body mb-3">You agree not to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-body-md text-body">
              <li>Use the Service for any unlawful purpose.</li>
              <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or extract the underlying AI models or algorithms.</li>
              <li>Use automated tools (bots, scrapers) to access the Service without written permission.</li>
              <li>Circumvent usage limits or access controls.</li>
              <li>Share your account credentials with others.</li>
              <li>Use the Service to compete with or replicate its functionality.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">9. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              The Service, including its design, code, and AI models, is owned by NotesChatAI and protected by intellectual property laws. These Terms do not grant you any rights to our trademarks, logos, or other brand features.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">10. Disclaimers</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components. AI Content is generated by third-party models and may be inaccurate.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              To the maximum extent permitted by law, NotesChatAI shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or revenue, whether incurred directly or indirectly.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">12. Termination</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              We may suspend or terminate your access to the Service at any time for conduct that violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third parties. You may terminate your account at any time by contacting us or using the account settings.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">13. Governing Law</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, United States, without regard to conflict of law principles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">14. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Material changes will be communicated via email or prominent notice on the Service. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display-md text-ink mb-3">15. Contact</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body">
              Questions about these Terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:legal@noteschatai.com" class="link-inline">legal@noteschatai.com</a> or visit our <a href="/contact" class="link-inline">Contact page</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
